 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A man named Ananias stood with his wife",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They sold a piece of property to the church",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Sapphira's knowledge he held back the price",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laying only a portion at the apostles' feet",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have not lied to men but to God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Satan filled your heart with a deadly lie",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The money was yours before the sale was made",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why contrive this thing in your heart so deep",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peter spoke the truth with a Spirit's eye",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why lie to the Holy Spirit's presence here",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While it remained unsold it was your own",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "After it was sold the cash was yours to keep",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have not lied to men but to God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Satan filled your heart with a deadly lie",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The money was yours before the sale was made",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why contrive this thing in your heart so deep",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When Ananias heard these words he fell down and died",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Great fear seized all who heard the tragic tale",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The young men rose and wrapped the body tight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying him out to bury him in the ground",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "About three hours later Sapphira came in",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not knowing what had befallen her husband",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peter asked the price she said it was true",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the feet of the mourners stood at the door",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At once she fell down at his feet and died",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Found dead by the young men who carried her out",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They buried her beside her husband in the earth",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Great fear came over the whole church of faith",
